# GreenPulse Web — env documentation
#
# ⚠️ This app does NOT need its own .env file.
# All runtime config comes from the ROOT monorepo file:
#   @ezstart/.env.local / .env.staging / .env.production
#
# See /SECRETS.md for the canonical architecture.
#
# Variables consumed by this web app (from root):
#   - JWT_SECRET                 → server-side session verification
#   - SENTRY_DSN_GREEN_PULSE     → error reporting (via getSentryDsn('green-pulse'))
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME / APP_DESCRIPTION / MAX_FILE_SIZE / ALLOWED_FILE_TYPES
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_EZAUTH_JWT_PUBLIC_KEY
